[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 12422.07, "timestamp": "03:27:02", "text": "你在做什么？我得回去了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12425.269, "timestamp": "03:27:05", "text": "基地也是。哦，你在杀什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12427.59, "timestamp": "03:27:07", "text": "好了，我回来了。不，不，我明白了。我得到了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12429.09, "timestamp": "03:27:09", "text": "它。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12431.91, "timestamp": "03:27:11", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12439.75, "timestamp": "03:27:19", "text": "所有操作都很卡顿。生活不是嘘。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12443.269, "timestamp": "03:27:23", "text": "让我改变，改变，这是我的声音"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12446.95, "timestamp": "03:27:26", "text": "滞后。我担心……不，不是这样的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12450.15, "timestamp": "03:27:30", "text": "你的直播为什么会中断？不。不。一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12453.95, "timestamp": "03:27:33", "text": "直播之类的。呃，这得到了……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12457.99, "timestamp": "03:27:37", "text": "相同的。好的。呃，我要弹B3低音。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12462.79, "timestamp": "03:27:42", "text": "质量。不，中等质量。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12464.309, "timestamp": "03:27:44", "text": "中等或低。随你便，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12466.71, "timestamp": "03:27:46", "text": "正确的？任何。我必须降低"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12469.91, "timestamp": "03:27:49", "text": "编码的东西。你知道，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12471.91, "timestamp": "03:27:51", "text": "呃，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12473.71, "timestamp": "03:27:53", "text": "加入"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12477.83, "timestamp": "03:27:57", "text": "游戏。代码在哪儿？首先是倪，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12479.229, "timestamp": "03:27:59", "text": "别再看你的"}]